"""Restaurant kitchen line health-inspection demo.

A patrol walker visits each station on the line (grill, fryer, cold prep).
Two checks run at every station:
  1. Temperature check: anything above 40 C is flagged as a violation.
  2. Visit log: every station visit is logged on the walker itself.
