"""Orchard irrigation tour.

A maintenance crew walks the grove, servicing pumps and sprinklers. A
single shared routine handles both device kinds via a union trigger,
logs the device kind, resets its idle counter, and tracks totals.
"""

node Device {
    has kind: str = "";
    has idle_hours: int = 0;
